title: Site v4.16.0 — Docs polish, course system, and the moment it clicked
summary: The Paradigm site crossed from "placeholder docs viewer" to a genuinely compelling product surface. Added breadcrumb navigation, sidebar filtering, 4 handwritten docs pages (CLI Reference, Flows, MCP Tools, Portal & Gates), a full course system with lesson rendering and quiz display, PLSAT certification page, and 2 extracurricular courses. The site now serves all five roles it was designed for — Museum, Library, University, Armory, Voice — with Library and University substantially fleshed out.
